                     NodeComment="Transition to Cycle early if the offset is too large. E.g. if the camera is on the right side of the character and the user presses forward, we don\'t want to strafe left for a long period of time, we want to jog forward.\r\nThis transition uses the SyncGroupNameToRequireValidMarkersRule setting to ensure we wait until there are valid sync markers so we smoothly enter Cycle."
